Short:        Collection of useful Cando source code.
Author:       tron@mclv.net (Joey McDonald)
Uploader:     tron mclv net (Joey McDonald)
Type:         dev/misc
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

The full Cando source code to my Vortex program as well as
an unfinished "deck" named Arc-Angel.

There is a LOT of useful cando code in these decks. Requesters,
directory scanning techniques, and MUCH more. Every cando
programmer should take a look.. it could save you a LOT
of time developing your own programs.

